<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Ryoji Kogori is the culprit... I see.<PG>
He has never once shown himself, and was the flayed body truly Ryoji Kogori or not? Had it been faked by some means or not?<PG>
If Ryoji Kogori were considered dead, he could carry out the later crimes at leisure, without worrying about alibis or the like.<PG>
At the least, judging from how things have gone so far, there is surely no doubt that he knew the part at the core of the incident.<PG>
The Ryoji Kogori culprit theory, it is quite intriguing.<PG>
{}
